1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,400
(Sheldon:)All right.

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,740
(Sheldon:)You're an actress.

3
00:00:04,870 --> 00:00:06,300
(Sheldon:)I need you to teach me.

4
00:00:06,310 --> 00:00:07,710
(Penny:)You want an acting lesson?

5
00:00:07,710 --> 00:00:10,940
(Sheldon:)Perhaps two. I'd like
to master the craft.

6
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:13,750
(Penny:)Okay, where
is this coming from?

7
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:17,620
(Sheldon:)It has been suggested to
me that acting techniques

8
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:19,620
(Sheldon:)could improve my
lecturing, at which,

9
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:21,950
(Sheldon:)if certain tweets and
blogs are to be believed,

10
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:23,860
I "suck the big one."

11
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:26,560
(Penny:)Yeah, I saw those.
They were funny.

12
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:29,460
(Penny:)I printed a few out
and put 'em on my fridge.

13
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:31,400
(Sheldon:)So, when could we start?

14
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:33,130
(Penny:)Okay, just to be clear.

15
00:00:33,130 --> 00:00:35,900
(Penny:)You are asking me for help
because I know something

16
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:38,340
(Penny:)that the brilliant
Dr. Sheldon Cooper doesn't.

17
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:42,140
(Sheldon:)I suppose that's one
way to look at it.

18
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:44,910
(Penny:)I think it's the only
way to look at it.

19
00:00:44,910 --> 00:00:46,810
(Sheldon:)Are you going to
help me or not?

20
00:00:46,810 --> 00:00:49,280
(Penny:)Probably. I'm just
enjoying the foreplay.

21
00:00:50,450 --> 00:00:52,850
(Penny:)Does this mean you are done
mocking my acting career?

22
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:55,950
(Sheldon:)Oh, I'm sorry, I thought
making the transition

23
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:57,820
(Sheldon:)from actor to acting teacher

24
00:00:57,820 --> 00:00:59,190
(Sheldon:)was the signal
that one's career

25
00:00:59,190 --> 00:01:02,020
(Sheldon:)had reached the
end of the road.

